    "householder": "work=A_hat; qt=I_m. sigma=sum_i(work[i,k]*work[i,k]); norm=math.sqrt(sigma); alpha=-copysign(norm,work[k,k]); v=active column with v[0]=work[k,k]-alpha; beta=2.0/sum_i(v[i]*v[i]). For every work/qt column: dot=sum_i(v[i]*column[i]); scale=beta*dot; column[i]=column[i]-v[i]*scale.",
    "sign": "after all reflectors R_hat=upper triangle of first n rows, qt=first n rows; zero/nonfinite norm/beta denominator/R diagonal STOP_CONSTRUCTION. For i ascending, negative R[i,i] negates that whole R row and qt row; R diagonal strictly positive.",
    "triangular": "for column s=0..m-1 ascending and i=n-1..0 descending, dot starts+0.0 then j=i+1..n-1 ascending separate mul/add; Y_hat[i,s]=(qt[i,s]-dot)/R[i,i]",
